. gen female = 0

. replace female = 1 if gender == 2
(313 real changes made)

. 
. gen asian = 0 

. replace asian = 1 if race == 2
(239 real changes made)

. 
. gen white = 0 

. replace white = 1 if race == 6
(101 real changes made)

